  message: "Cross-link (mirror): WI-madal (run crashes on unreadable file, uncaught PermissionError) is RELATED_BUT_DISTINCT, not a member. The top-level OSError handler proposed here makes that crash GRACEFUL (clean exit), but WI-madal additionally requires fail-OPEN (skip the file, emit partial JSON per section 17). HAZARD: landing this handler will erase WI-madal traceback symptom without satisfying section 17 — do NOT close WI-madal on the strength of this item. See WI-madal discussion for the full three-level (leaf-read / fingerprint-prepass / orchestrator) analysis."  # 97e2
