  message: "DONE — PR #546 (selfh/dev 6f1279d6c2). main()'s dispatch gains a top-level 'except Exception as exc' safety net after the typed SubstrateError (rc=2) + BrokenPipeError handlers: an unanticipated error becomes a clean 'hypergumbo: internal error: <Type>: <msg>' + 're-run with --debug for a full traceback' on stderr + rc=1, instead of a raw Python traceback. Under --debug the original exception is re-raised (traceback preserved). Catches Exception (not BaseException), so argparse SystemExit (--help/parse errors) + KeyboardInterrupt (Ctrl-C) propagate normally. EVIDENCE (production-path, in-process main() dispatch): test_main_unexpected_exception_exits_1_with_clean_message (monkeypatched cmd raising RuntimeError -> rc=1, stderr has 'internal error'/'RuntimeError'/'kaboom'/'--debug') + test_main_unexpected_exception_reraises_under_debug (--debug -> RuntimeError propagates). The audit note's hazard respected: WI-madal (§17 fail-open) is NOT closed on this — it is separate and already done. Last standalone of the cli-input block. Core 100% coverage."  # 094e
